You chant the glory of the Sun, empowering your light and fire elemental attacks so that they do [28%, 38%, 46%, 52%, 58% (TL1-5; SP 100)] additional damage.

In addition, this talent surrounds you with a shield of light, dealing [14, 19, 23, 26, 28 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage to anything that hits you in melee.

Your lite radius is also increased by [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].

You may only have one Chant active at once and this Chant costs less power to sustain.

The effects will increase with your Spellpower.
